  (text "J601 = 4-in-1 ESC, JST-SH 8-pin. Betaflight Connector Standard pinout:\n1=VBAT  2=GND  3=CURR  4=TLM  5=M1  6=M2  7=M3  8=M4.  Mount tabs -> GND.\nDShot300 is 3.3 V push-pull - NO series resistors on M1-M4.\nExternal ESC current sense: R601 (10k) + C601 (100nF) = ~1 ms RC; scale set in Betaflight."
    (at 128.27 156.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "dcda0a25-3e02-40b3-88e9-4ea2fc9ed48d")
  )
  (text "M1-M4 timers (STM32F405 datasheet DS8626 Table 9, AF2 = TIM3/4/5):\nPB0 = TIM3_CH3   PB1 = TIM3_CH4   PB4 = TIM3_CH1   PB5 = TIM3_CH2.\nDShot per-channel DMA (TIM3 on DMA1): CH3->Str7  CH4->Str2  CH1->Str4  CH2->Str5\n- four distinct streams, the motors do not conflict with each other.\nFLAG: DMA1 Str2/Str5/Str7 also carry SPI3 (blackbox flash) and I2C1 (baro) DMA\nrequests - confirm the Betaflight target DMA table (pinmap \"Open DMA item\")."
    (at 128.27 175.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "55dc2aff-e055-4a81-83c1-89f09ed58d56")
  )
  (text "J602: 2.54 mm M1-M4 breakout for bench motor testing.\nDNP - dev only (do not populate on flight builds)."
    (at 198.12 173.99 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1f8ce45b-4584-4b72-a20b-216dfa12ce08")
  )
